{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Genie Shoes are a ",["l","鞋类","footwear"]," item in Stardew Valley. They can be obtained from ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chests"],". They can be found as a ",["l","矿井","special item"]," on floors 81-119 of ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],", in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", or in the ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"]," by killing ",["l","矿井","special monsters"]," or by breaking ",["l","矿井","crates and barrels"],"."]],["p",["They have the second highest ",["l","免疫","immunity"]," buff in the game for ",["l","鞋类","footwear"]," at +6, just behind the ",["l","美人鱼靴","Mermaid Boots"]," at +8 and just ahead of the ",["l","灰烬小丑鞋","Cinderclown Shoes"]," at +5."]]]]]}